    <ol class="space-y-2.5 text-[13px] text-ink-soft">
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">01</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#script">文案/脚本结构</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">02</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#visual">视觉/画面分析</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">03</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#viral">爆款因素诊断</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">04</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#template">可复用模板提炼</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-report w-5 shrink-0">05</span><a class="hover:text-ink transition-colors leading-[1.5]" href="#actions">可抄动作清单</a></li>
